</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Far too well thy Savior loves thee</l><l>To allow thy life to be</l><l>One long, calm, unbroken summer—</l><l>One unruffled, stormless sea;</l><l>He would have thee fondly nestling</l><l>Closer to His loving breast,</l><l>He would have that day seem brighter</l><l>When alone is perfect rest.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
